THOUGHT: The outage failure is caused by durable events being broadcast only through each node’s in-memory socket list, so subscribers on another node never receive writes or replay frames. I’ll persist channel event payloads in SQLite, have every WebSocket connection poll and replay those events, and change `start.sh` to supervise and respawn each HTTP node independently.

